m-devbox — a portable, container-delivered M development environment: one
pinned image carrying YottaDB, the five native m-stdlib callouts, the `m` /
`m-ydb` toolchain, and the M Standard Library.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components (assembled at build time, NOT vendored here)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository contains no third-party source. Everything below is fetched or
copied into an ephemeral build context by scripts/stage-context.sh and lands in
the built image; each keeps its own license.

  YottaDB (r2.06, pinned)                 — AGPL-3.0-or-later (YottaDB LLC).
      Installed at build time by the YottaDB project's own ydbinstall.sh,
      pinned to an immutable commit and verified with sha256sum -c.

  ydbinstall.sh                           — AGPL-3.0-or-later (YottaDB LLC),
      fetched from gitlab.com/YottaDB/DB/YDB at a pinned commit.

  Debian GNU/Linux (trixie-slim, pinned by digest) and the runtime packages
      installed into it (libcurl, libssl, zlib, libzstd) — the licenses of
      their respective Debian source packages.

  m-stdlib (MSL routines + native callout sources) · m-cli (`m`) · m-ydb
      — vista-forge, AGPL-3.0-or-later + commercial, same terms as this repo.

